                                        @*<asp:LinkButton runat="server" ID="btnCAncel" Width="100%" CssClass="w3-btn w3-small  nln-bg w3-text-white" OnClick="btnCAncel_Click"> <i class="fa fa-backward"> </i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Back to Job</asp:LinkButton>*@

