                                                                                <Telerik:RadNumericTextBox ID="txtlong" runat="server" Width="100%" Text='<%#Eval("SiteLong") %>' NumberFormat-DecimalDigits="11" CssClass="form-control Longitude">
                                                                                </Telerik:RadNumericTextBox>
                                                                                <asp:RequiredFieldValidator ID="rdfLong" runat="server" CssClass="valid rdf-initial rdf-text" ControlToValidate="txtlong" ValidationGroup="EditSave" ErrorMessage="* Required"></asp:RequiredFieldValidator>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div class="col-lg-2 col-md-2 col-xs-6 col-sm-3">
                                                                                <label>Man Hours Available</label>
                                                                                <Telerik:RadNumericTextBox ID="txtManHrsAvai" runat="server" Enabled="false" Width="100%" Text='<%#Eval("ManHoursAvailable") %>' CssClass="form-control txtManHoursAvailable ">
                                                                                </Telerik:RadNumericTextBox>
                                                                            </div>

                                                                            <%-- Changes On 10 July 2019--%>
                                                                            <div id="divMaintainInventory" runat="server" class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3 divMaintainInventory" style="margin-top: 8px; display: inline-flex; padding-left: 10px">
                                                                                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="checkboxMaintainInventory" Checked='<%#Eval("MaintainInventory").ToString()=="False" ?false:true %>' />
                                                                                <label style="margin-left: 10px;">Maintain Inventory At Site</label>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div id="divMaintainInventoryAtJob" runat="server" class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3 divMaintainInventoryAtJob" style="margin-top: 8px; display: inline-flex; padding-left: 10px">

                                                                                <%--  Changes on 12 Sep 2019  for Test And Prod --%>
                                                                                <%--   <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="checkboxMaintainInventoryAtJob" Checked='<%#Eval("MaintainInventoryAtJob").ToString()=="True" ?true:false %>' />--%>

                                                                                <%--  Changes on 12 Sep 2019  for Inpex Only--%>
                                                                                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="checkboxMaintainInventoryAtJob" Checked='<%#Eval("MaintainInventoryAtJob").ToString()=="False" ?false:true %>' />
                                                                                <label style="margin-left: 10px;">Maintain Inventory At Job</label>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div id="divCycloneManagement" runat="server" class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3 divCycloneManagement" style="margin-top: 8px; display: inline-flex; padding-left: 10px">

                                                                                <%--  Changes on 12 Sep 2019  for Test And Prod --%>
                                                                                <%--                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="checkboxCycloneManagement" Checked='<%#Eval("CycloneManagement").ToString()=="True" ?true:false %>' />--%>

                                                                                <%--  Changes on 12 Sep 2019  for Inpex Only--%>
                                                                                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="checkboxCycloneManagement" Checked='<%#Eval("CycloneManagement").ToString()=="False" ?false:true %>' />
                                                                                <label style="margin-left: 10px;">Cyclone Management</label>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div id="divManHourMngAtSite" runat="server" class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3  divManHourMngAtSite" style="margin-top: 8px; display: inline-flex; padding-left: 10px">

                                                                                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="chkboxManHoursManagement" Checked='<%#Eval("ManHoursManagement").ToString()=="True" ?true:false %>' />
                                                                                <label style="margin-left: 10px;">Man Hours Management</label>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div id="divGpsSitePin" runat="server" class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3  divGpsSitePin" style="margin-top:9px; display: inline-flex; padding-left: 10px">
                                                                                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="chkboxEnabledGPSSitePin" Checked='<%#Eval("EnabledGPSSitePin").ToString()=="True" ?true:false %>' />
                                                                                <label style="margin-left: 10px;">Enabled GPS Site Pin</label>
                                                                            </div>

                                                                            <%--Add Code on 30/march/2020--%>
                                                                            <div id="divCaptureGps" runat="server" class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3  divCaptureGps" style="margin-top:9px; display: inline-flex; padding-left: 10px">
                                                                                <asp:CheckBox runat="server" ID="chkboxEnabledCaptureGps" Checked='<%#Eval("EnabledCaptureGps").ToString()=="True" ?true:false %>' />
                                                                                <label style="margin-left: 10px;">Enabled GPS Capture</label>
                                                                            </div>

                                                                            <%-- add code on 23-Feb-2020--%>
                                                                            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-xs-12 col-sm-3 ">
